---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import heroImage from '../../assets/images/ambiente-preparado.png';
---

<section id="hero-preparado" class="relative w-full overflow-hidden bg-[#fdfaf5]" style="height: 600px; position: relative;">
  
  <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" style="position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 1;">
    <Image 
      src={heroImage} 
      alt="Ambiente preparado Montessori" 
      class="object-cover object-center block"
      widths={[320, 640, 1024, 1280]}
      sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 1280px"
      loading="eager"
      style="position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100% !important; height: 100% !important; object-fit: cover;"
    />
  </div>

  <div 
    class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none"
    style="position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 2; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65); background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0.95) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.65) 50%, rgba(0,0,0,0.45) 100%);"
  ></div>

  <div 
    class="mx-auto px-6 text-center text-white flex flex-col items-center justify-center space-y-6 sm:space-y-8"
    style="position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); z-index: 3; width: 100%; max-width: 1200px; text-align: center;"
  >
    <h2 class="hero-title anim-fade-up font-bold leading-tight tracking-wide text-white w-full shadow-text"
      style="text-align: center; width: 100%;">
      <span class="villa">Villa</span>
      <span class="montessori">Montessori</span>
    </h2>
    
    <h1 
      class="anim-fade-up font-bold leading-tight tracking-wide text-white w-full shadow-text"
      style="text-align: center; width: 100%; color: #ffffff !important;"
    >
      El lugar donde su curiosidad natural <br class="hidden md:block" /> se vuelve aprendizaje.
    </h1>
    
    <p 
      class="anim-fade-up anim-delay-1 max-w-4xl font-medium leading-relaxed w-full mx-auto shadow-text-light"
      style="text-align: center; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; color: #f5f5f4 !important;"
    >
      Te invitamos a caminar por nuestras aulas y ver cómo un ambiente preparado transforma el juego en descubrimiento. Ven a conocernos y encuentra la comunidad que buscas para tu hijo.
    </p>
    
    <div 
      class="anim-fade-up anim-delay-2 pt-6 w-full flex items-center justify-center" 
      style="display: flex; justify-content: center; width: 100%;"
    >
      <a 
        href="#admisiones" 
        class="hero-btn-visita btn btn-primary btn-round inline-block rounded-full bg-[#ff5122] px-8 py-3 font-semibold text-white tracking-wide transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-[#e6441a] hover:-translate-y-0.5"
        style="color: #ffffff !important; background-color: #ff5122 !important;"
      >
        Agendar Visita
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style is:global>
  #hero-preparado img {
    position: absolute !important;
    left: 0 !important;
    top: 0 !important;
    width: 100% !important;
    height: 100% !important;
    min-width: 100% !important;
    min-height: 100% !important;
    max-height: none !important;
  }

  .shadow-text {
    text-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
  }

  .shadow-text-light {
    text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
  }

  /* Tamaños para Mobile (por defecto) */
  .hero-title {
    font-size: 3rem; /* text-5xl equivalent */
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 2.25rem; /* text-4xl equivalent */
  }

  p {
    font-size: 1rem; /* text-base equivalent */
  }

 

  .anim-fade-up {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(20px); 
    animation: fadeInUp 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards; 
  }

  .anim-delay-1 {
    animation-delay: 0.2s;
  }
  
  .anim-delay-2 {
    animation-delay: 0.6s;
  }

  @keyframes fadeInUp {
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0); 
    }
  }

  .hero-title .villa {
    color: #4CAF50;
  }

  .hero-title .montessori {
    color: #ff7322;
  }
</style>